<!DOCTYPE article PUBLIC "-//NLM//DTD Journal Archiving and Interchange DTD v2.3 20070202//EN" "archivearticle.dtd"><article article-type="correction" xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"><?properties open_access?><front><journal-meta><journal-id journal-id-type="nlm-ta">J Cell Biol</journal-id><journal-title>The Journal of Cell Biology</journal-title><issn pub-type="ppub">0021-9525</issn><issn pub-type="epub">1540-8140</issn><publisher><publisher-name>The Rockefeller University Press</publisher-name></publisher></journal-meta><article-meta><article-id pub-id-type="pmc">2132806</article-id><article-categories><subj-group subj-group-type="heading"><subject>Correction</subject></subj-group></article-categories><title-group><article-title>Correction</article-title></title-group><pub-date pub-type="ppub"><day>5</day><month>10</month><year>1998</year></pub-date><volume>143</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>277</fpage><lpage>277</lpage><copyright-year>1998</copyright-year><related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" vol="140" page="1383" id="N0x198f930N0x39fd620" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="9508771" ext-link-type="pubmed"/></article-meta></front><body><p> Honda et al. Vol. 140, No. 6, March 1998. Pages 1383&#x02013;1393.The underlined portion of the text below indicates the corrected sequence which appeared in the  Materials and Methods on p. 1384.Multiple tissue Northern blots I and II were purchased from <named-content content-type="company" xlink:href="clontech">CLONTECH</named-content> Laboratories and hybridization was performed using a <sup>32</sup>P-labeled oligonucleotide probe (5&#x02032;-<underline>GCGACTATGTGT</underline><underline>CAGAGAGCCGA</underline>-3&#x02032;) specific to actinin-4, as described previously (Sambrook et al., 1989).</p></body></article>